Fact resource Derived from owner-of.resource
Fact owner    Derived from owner-of.owner
Fact actor    Derived from owner
// Fact in-group Identified by resource * actor

Function owner-of Identified by resource * owner // at most one owner per resource

Placeholder new-owner For owner
Act change-owner Related to resource, new-owner
  Creates owner-of(resource, new-owner) When Enabled(change-owner())
  Terminates owner-of(resource, actor)
  Holds when owner-of(resource, actor)
